## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical use of data ingestion, governance, masking, and a simple warehouse, plus Purview lineage.

## Key Concepts
- Ingestion from multiple sources into ADLS Gen2
- Schema inference and drift handling via Data Flows
- PII masking strategies in pipelines
- Data catalog and lineage in Purview
- Star schema in Synapse

## Code Example
```javascript
function maskPII(value, type){
  switch(type){
    case 'email': return value.replace(/[^@]+@/, '***@');
    case 'ssn': return value.replace(/\d{3}-\d{2}-\d{4}/, 'XXX-XX-XXXX');
    default: return 'MASKED';
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test masking rules across schemas?
- How would you validate lineage completeness in Purview?
